#. USD import overview, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:10.
msgid ""
"`USD <https://openusd.org/release/index.html>`__ files typically "
"represent the scene as a hierarchy of primitives, or `prims "
"<https://graphics.pixar.com/usd/release/glossary.html#USDGlossary-"
"Prim>`__. Individual prims contain data to describe scene entities, such "
"as geometry, lights, cameras and transform hierarchies. Blender's USD "
"importer converts USD prims to a hierarchy of Blender objects. Like the "
"USD exporter, the importer does not yet handle certain USD composition "
"concepts, such as layers and references."
msgstr ""
"`USD <https://openusd.org/release/index.html>`__-filer representerar "
"normalt scenen som en hierarki av primitiver, eller `prims "
"<https://graphics.pixar.com/usd/release/glossary.html#USDGlossary-"
"Prim>`__. Enskilda prims innehåller data som beskriver scenelement, till "
"exempel geometri, ljus, kameror och transformhierarkier. Blenders USD-"
"importör omvandlar USD-prims till en hierarki av Blender-objekt. Liksom "
"USD-exportören hanterar importören ännu inte vissa USD-"
"kompositionsbegrepp, till exempel lager och referenser."

#. USDZ texture import advice, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:32.
msgid ""
"When importing a `USDZ archive "
"<https://openusd.org/release/spec_usdz.html>`__, it is important to "
"carefully consider the :ref:`Import Textures <usd-import-textures>` "
"option to determine whether and how to copy texture files from the zip "
"archive."
msgstr ""
"Vid import av ett `USDZ-arkiv "
"<https://openusd.org/release/spec_usdz.html>`__ är det viktigt att noga "
"överväga alternativet :ref:`Import Textures <usd-import-textures>` för "
"att avgöra om och hur texturfiler ska kopieras från ZIP-arkivet."

#. USD Scope primitive description, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:44.
msgid ""
"USD also supports ``Scope`` primitives, which are entities that do not "
"contain transform data, but which serve to group other element of the "
"scene. Blender doesn't have an exact counterpart to the concept of a "
"scope, so such primitives are imported as Blender empties located at the "
"origin. This is an imperfect representation, because empty objects have a"
" transform and ``Scopes`` do not, but this approach nonetheless helps "
"preserve the structure of the scene hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"USD stöder även ``Scope``-primitiver, som är enheter utan transformdata "
"och som används för att gruppera andra scenelement. Blender har ingen "
"direkt motsvarighet till scope-begreppet, så sådana primitiver importeras "
"som tomma Blender-objekt vid origo. Det är en ofullständig representation, "
"eftersom tomma objekt har en transform och ``Scope``-primitiver inte har "
"det, men detta bevarar ändå scenhierarkins struktur."

#. USD PointInstancer heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:53.
msgid "PointInstancer Primitives"
msgstr "PointInstancer-primitiver"

#. USD PointInstancer description, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:55.
msgid ""
"USD provides a ``UsdGeomPointInstancer`` prim type, containing instances "
"that are scattered on a primitive's points."
msgstr ""
"USD tillhandahåller primtypen ``UsdGeomPointInstancer``, som innehåller "
"instanser spridda över en primitivs punkter."

#. USD PointInstancer import implementation, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:58.
msgid ""
"These are imported into Blender as Point Clouds using a "
":doc:`/modeling/modifiers/geometry_nodes` and the "
":doc:`/modeling/geometry_nodes/instances/instance_on_points`."
msgstr ""
"Blender importerar dem som punktmoln med en "
":doc:`/modeling/modifiers/geometry_nodes` och noden "
":doc:`/modeling/geometry_nodes/instances/instance_on_points`."
